## Header (`_sections/Header.html`) &mdash; Mini Cart

### Fixes Applied (2026-07-22)
| Fix | Detail |
|---|---|
| Thumbnail link went nowhere useful | `li-js-object:href="item.title"` &rarr; should be `item.url` (was binding the href to the product title text, not a URL). |
| Item title stopped updating | The title `<a>` combined `li-js-object:href="item.url"` **and** bare `li-js-object="item.title"` on one element &mdash; this native runtime only binds one `li-js-object` per element. Split into `<a li-js-object:href="item.url"><span li-js-object="item.title">` to match the thumbnail's existing href/content-split pattern. |
