## Cart Page (`li-page="cart"`)
 
### Section
```
li-section              = Cart
li-section:on_templates = cart
```
 
### Key Liquiflow Patterns
 
**Show/hide form vs empty state:**
```
li-if = cart.item_count > 0     &larr; wraps entire cart form
li-if = cart.item_count == 0    &larr; wraps empty cart state
```
 
**Cart form:**
```
li-form      = cart
li-form:cart = (empty value)
```
 
**Cart items loop:**
```
li-for = item in cart.items
```
 
**Item fields:**
```
li-object:href = item.url
li-object:src  = item.image | image_url: width: 200
li-object      = item.title           &larr; on link element (combined with li-object:href &mdash; valid)
li-object      = item.variant.title
li-object:href = item.url_to_remove
```
 
**Price display (correct pattern):**
```
[no li-if on outer wrapper]     &larr; always show final price
  li-object = item.final_line_price | money
 
[inner compare-at wrapper]
  li-if     = item.original_line_price > item.final_line_price
  li-object = item.original_line_price | money
```
> Outer wrapper must NOT have `li-if` &mdash; otherwise non-discounted items show no price.
 
**Cart summary:**
```
li-object = cart.original_total_price | money   &larr; cart total before discounts
li-if     = cart.total_discounts > 0            &larr; savings row
li-object = cart.total_discounts | money        &larr; note: plural "discounts"
li-object = cart.total_price | money            &larr; subtotal after discounts
```
 
**Cart form buttons:**
```
Update button:   li-attribute:name  = update
                 li-attribute:value = Update cart
 
Checkout button: li-attribute:name  = checkout
                 li-attribute:value = Checkout
```
 
**Cart note:**
```
id                 = CartNote
li-attribute:name  = note
```
 
**Empty cart CTA:**
```
li-object:href    = routes.root_url
li-settings:text  = CTA Label
```
 
### Monogram Line Item Properties Display
**Built** in `_sections/Cart.html`, inside `cart_item_head`, after the variant title:
 
```
Div [cart_item_properties]          &larr; no Liquiflow attribute
  &#9492;&#9472;&#9472; Div [property_row]            &larr; li-for="property in item.properties"
        &#9492;&#9472;&#9472; Div [property_content]  &larr; li-unless="property.last == blank or property.first contains '_'"
              &#9500;&#9472;&#9472; Span              &larr; li-object="property.first"   (property name/label)
              &#9492;&#9472;&#9472; Span              &larr; li-object="property.last"    (property value)
```
 
> Properties prefixed with `_` are hidden from customers (internal/app use).
> Properties with blank values are also suppressed.
 
